      "text": "POST /api/v1/calls/browser-sandbox\n     → { callId, streamSid }\nWS   /api/streams/browser\n     ↑ binary PCM frames\n     ↓ media · clear · ready\n       turn_latency · voice_error\nGET  /api/v1/calls/history\n     ?outcome &language\n     &needsHuman &search\nGET  /api/v1/calls/:id\nCRUD /api/v1/modules\nPOST /api/v1/auth/login · /google\nGET  /api/v1/metrics",
      "originalText": "POST /api/v1/calls/browser-sandbox\n     → { callId, streamSid }\nWS   /api/streams/browser\n     ↑ binary PCM frames\n     ↓ media · clear · ready\n       turn_latency · voice_error\nGET  /api/v1/calls/history\n     ?outcome &language\n     &needsHuman &search\nGET  /api/v1/calls/:id\nCRUD /api/v1/modules\nPOST /api/v1/auth/login · /google\nGET  /api/v1/metrics",
